Exod 6:1 , God renews his promise by his name JEHOVAH;
Exod 6:9 , Moses vainly attempts to encourage the Israelites;
Exod 6:10 , He and Aaron are again sent to Pharaoh;
Exod 6:14 , The genealogy of Reuben, of Simeon, and of Levi, of whom came Moses and Aaron;
Exod 6:26 , The history resumed.
